    //   S->C  hqc { f1: challenger, f2: challenged, f3: challenge id }
    //   C->S  hpu { f1: id }              decline
    //   C->S  hpu { f1: id, f2: 1 }       ACCEPT
    //   S->C  hpv { f1: challenger, f2: id, f3: 1 if accepted, f4: challenged }
    //
    // The difference between accepting and declining is that f2 of the hpu, and it is seen in all four without
    // exception: the two decline captures send «08e903» and «08ea03», bare, and the accept one
    // sends «08ec031001». The hpv repeats it in its f3: it is in the two accepted ones and in none of
    // the declined ones.

