    //   f1{f1=2  f2{f1=1 f4=3} f3=1 }    3 versus 3, open
    //   f1{f1=3  f2{     f4=3}      }    another of three, WITHOUT f3: closed
    //
    // Index zero does not travel, which is normal in protobuf; and the fourth is told apart by not
    // carrying the f3 nor the inner f1.

